OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFine during
OL,6,Fthe evening and overnight, with clear
OL,7,Fperiods. Becoming windier in the north
OL,8,Ftowards dawn, with cloud thickening
OL,9,Fand lowering here as the south stays
OL,10,Fclearer. Temperatures generally near
OL,11,Faverage.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FFine at first, however
OL,14,Fbecoming windier and cloudier from the
OL,15,Fnorth, with periods of rain edging
OL,16,Fsouthwards. Rain easing later, perhaps
OL,17,Fbrightening up in the north before
OL,18,Fdusk. Warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
