OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FMainly
OL,6,Ffine Sunday, but turning more
OL,7,Fchangeable into new week. Warm by day
OL,8,Fat first, ahead of some heavy rain
OL,9,FMonday into Tuesday, giving way to
OL,10,Fcooler, brighter conditions.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
